msgstr "Pindai model kedua"

#: src/onboarding.py:718
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Tidak dapat merekam model kedua"

#: src/onboarding.py:719
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must still "
"be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than turning it "
"off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Model pertama Anda disimpan, jadi login wajah sudah berfungsi. Ruangan harus "
"tetap cukup terang untuk melihat wajah Anda — ubah lampunya daripada "
"mematikannya — lalu coba lagi, atau lewati dan tambahkan model nanti dari "
"Pengaturan."

#: src/onboarding.py:753
msgid "Second scan: glasses, facial hair or different lighting"
msgstr "Pemindaian kedua: kacamata, rambut wajah, atau pencahayaan berbeda"

#: src/onboarding.py:755
msgid ""
"First model saved: face login already works. A second model makes "
"recognition more reliable when something changes: put on the glasses you "
"sometimes wear (or take them off), or record it with different facial hair, "
"and change the light — turn a lamp on or off, move away from the window. "
"Keep your face clearly visible and press Scan again; the same short guided "
"capture follows."
msgstr ""
"Model pertama disimpan: masuk dengan wajah sudah berfungsi. Model kedua "
"membuat pengenalan lebih andal saat ada yang berubah: pakai kacamata yang "
"kadang Anda kenakan (atau lepaskan), rekam dengan rambut wajah yang berbeda, "
"dan ubah cahaya — nyalakan atau matikan lampu, menjauh dari jendela. Jaga "
"wajah tetap terlihat jelas dan tekan Pindai lagi; perekaman terpandu singkat "
"yang sama akan mengikuti."

#: src/onboarding.py:797
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware and tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dapat secara otomatis membuka kunci {} Anda menggunakan "
"otentikasi wajah (dompet terdeteksi: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Status TPM:</b> Memeriksa perangkat keras dan alat TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:817
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dapat secara otomatis membuka kunci {} Anda menggunakan "
"otentikasi wajah (dompet terdeteksi: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Status TPM:</b> Perangkat keras TPM terdeteksi. Menginstal <i>tpm2-tools</"
"i> secara otomatis..."

#: src/onboarding.py:829
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dapat secara otomatis membuka kunci {} Anda menggunakan "
"otentikasi wajah (dompet terdeteksi: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Status TPM:</b> TPM 2.0 perangkat keras aktif. Kata sandi Anda akan "
"tersegel dengan aman di dalam TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:831
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dapat secara otomatis membuka kunci {} Anda menggunakan "
"otentikasi wajah (dompet terdeteksi: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Status TPM:</b> Perangkat keras TPM terdeteksi, tetapi pemasangan "
"otomatis <i>tpm2-tools</i> gagal. Jalankan <code>sudo apt install tpm2-"
"tools</code>. Kembali ke cache kredensial berbasis perangkat lunak."

#: src/onboarding.py:833
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dapat secara otomatis membuka kunci {} Anda menggunakan "
"otentikasi wajah (dompet terdeteksi: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Status TPM:</b> Tidak ada perangkat keras TPM yang terdeteksi. "
"Menggunakan cache kredensial berbasis perangkat lunak (AES-256-GCM)."

