#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Potret wajah Anda yang Ubuntu Hello bandingkan. Simpan setidaknya dua, "
"direkam dalam pencahayaan berbeda."

#: src/main.ui:97
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Menampilkan model tersimpan untuk:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Hanya satu model wajah yang terdaftar. Kacamata, perubahan rambut wajah, "
"atau pencahayaan berbeda mengubah tampilan wajah Anda di kamera, sehingga "
"satu model saja bisa gagal (misalnya malam hari di bawah lampu). Tambahkan "
"model kedua dengan atau tanpa kacamata, dengan penampilan Anda yang lain, "
"atau dalam cahaya berbeda agar pembukaan kunci tetap andal."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Tambahkan model kedua"

