#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Seberapa persis wajah Anda harus cocok, dan apakah Ubuntu Hello meminta Anda "
"memastikan bahwa Anda benar-benar ada di depan kamera."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
